You are an AI coding assistant working on SpacetimeCRM.

## Stack
FastAPI (Python) + React 18 + Vite 6 + SpacetimeDB

## Build & Test
- Build: `cd web && npm run build`
- Test: No tests yet — add `pytest server/` for backend, `vitest run` for frontend
- Lint: `cd web && npx tsc --noEmit`

## Conventions
- SpacetimeDB for all data (no Supabase)
- All mutations go through STDB reducers via `_call()`
- All queries go through `_sql()` or `_sql_t()` (tenant-filtered)
- Every mutation audits via `_log_audit()`
- Role-based access via `require_role()` FastAPI dependency

## Ports
- 5185 Vite dev server (no longer in use — API serves built frontend)
- 8723 FastAPI backend (serves API + static frontend from web/dist/)
- 3001 SpacetimeDB

## Documentation
- AGENTS.md — full agent onboarding
- CLAUDE.md — Claude Code quickstart
- Makefile — build/test/lint targets (`make help`)
